        "text": "Step 3: To find the range of $x^4 + 4x^2$, we first solve the equality $x^4 + 4x^2 = -4$ to see if there are any real solutions, which would help us understand the lower bound of the inequality. However, since $x^4 + 4x^2$ is always non-negative, this equation has no real solutions."
